      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Captain Steele Smith and his family first settled Windsor in August 1764, arriving from Farmington, Connecticut.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Windsor%2C_Vermont",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Windsor became Vermont’s first town to build a railroad depot, opening the town to tourists and market trade.",
